## Definitions

For purposes of this License:

**“Public Instrument”** means the standalone browser-local Fieldglass HTML release, documentation, public samples, public schemas, public examples, and public release artifacts included in this repository.

**“Commercial Use”** means use primarily intended for commercial advantage, paid service delivery, resale, managed service delivery, enterprise platform integration, vendor product integration, commercial hosting, software-as-a-service delivery, or revenue-generating deployment.

**“Derivative Work”** includes modified versions, translations, ports, wrappers, hosted versions, embedded versions, adapted versions, rebranded versions, and substantially similar systems based on or derived from the Public Instrument.

**“Canonical Output”** means output generated by the unmodified Public Instrument using the published public schemas and unmodified runtime/evidence semantics supplied in this repository.

