1. Purpose
This license permits public-interest, educational, research, accountability, audit-support, and non-commercial evaluation use of the SubstrateX Runtime Evidence Observatory public instrument and related materials.

2. Permitted Uses
Subject to the restrictions below, you may:
(a) view, download, and run the public instrument locally;
(b) use the instrument for non-commercial research, education, public accountability, internal evaluation, and evidence generation;
(c) share unmodified copies of the public instrument and documentation with attribution;
(d) cite, discuss, benchmark, and evaluate the public instrument;
(e) generate evidence artifacts from your own logs, subject to your own rights and responsibilities in those logs.

